subject: security(middleware): implement rate limiter + header sanitizer (GAP-P1-17)

Replace placeholder src/lib/middleware/index.js with full middleware module:

- rateLimiter.js: per-IP sliding window (120 req/min) + burst cap (30/5s)
  using trusted x-9r-real-ip from custom-server.js for IP bucketing
- headerSanitizer.js: strips injection chars (CRLF/null), oversized headers,
  and server-only headers (x-9r-real-ip, x-9r-peer-token, x-9r-via-proxy)
  unless request came through trusted proxy
- index.js: barrel export of all middleware utilities

Wire into dashboardGuard.js proxy():
1. Sanitize request headers before any route logic (mutates in place)
2. Apply rate limiting to /api/* and /dashboard routes
3. Return 429 with Retry-After + X-RateLimit-* headers when exceeded

21 new tests in tests/unit/middleware.test.js (all pass).
44 existing dashboard-guard tests pass (no regressions).

